 "notes": [
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0458.mbb#0.43",
   "note": "#0.43-0.45 are the tail of the 14-way leader block #0.32-0.45. Order from 0458.bla: God, 00, Wing Zero, Zeta, Nu, Zero, Mebius, Ultraman, Seven, OOO, W, Den-O Sword Form, Black RX, Rider 1. So #0.43 = Momotaros (rough), #0.44 = Black RX, #0.45 = Rider 1 (uses watashi-tachi -> 'We')."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0458.mbb#0.51",
   "note": "0458.bla only shows #0.51 (MessWinSet offset 50, no variant index; speaker = current leader, the 'Rider 1' label is the extractor's default). #0.52-0.64 are unused identical variants, kept identical."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0458.mbb#0.65",
   "note": "Ankh; 'kesshou shinshutsu' = advancing to the finals, subject 'us' restored."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0459.mbb#0.1",
   "note": "Dai-4-sou -> 'Floor 4', matching 'Floor 3' in story_083."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0461.mbb#0.3",
   "note": "'Kuchi hodo ni mo nai yatsu' (all talk) rendered in Zamsha's formal register."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0461.mbb#0.6",
   "note": "Nod to Goemon's stock line from Lupin III ('I have cut a worthless thing'). Source has no 'again' (mata), so none added."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0461.mbb#0.7",
   "note": "Zamsha notices the heroes; source trails off ('You are...'), kept unfinished."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0461.mbb#0.8",
   "note": "0461.bla only shows #0.8 (speaker = current leader); #0.9-0.21 are unused identical variants, kept identical."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0462.mbb#0.3",
   "note": "0462.bla leader order (4 rows each from #0.3): Ultraman, Seven, Mebius, Zero, Nu, Zeta, God, Wing Zero, 00 (#0.35-0.38, continues into story_086). All four rows are the leader's. 'Yahari ... wo!!' completed as 'he has the flame' (Taro was expected to be guarding the energy-core ember, story_069 #0.191). Lowercase 'energy core' as in story_069."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0462.mbb#0.11",
   "note": "Mebius: 'Taro-niisan' -> 'Brother Taro' per style.honorifics."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0462.mbb#0.5",
   "note": "Silent '......' beats kept as '...' for every variant."
  }
 ],
 "report": "80/80 rows. Leader-variant orders read from 0458/0461/0462.bla (see notes). 0458 #0.51 and 0461 #0.8 are spoken by the current leader (labels are extractor defaults); 0458 #0.52-0.64 and 0461 #0.9-0.21 are unused by the scripts. 'energy core' kept lowercase as in story_069. No new names."
